<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Argentaria Q3 profit slightly down.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Argentaria Q3 profit slightly down.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a consensus of analyst forecasts for Grupo Argentaria third quarter results. (billions of pesetas unless stated):</p>
<p> ARGENTARIA			Q3 1996   Q3 1995	 RANGE</p>
<p>   Net interest income	 146.56    153.05   144.68 - 148.62</p>
<p>   Operating margin	     74.74     64.51    69.62 -  80.48</p>
<p>   Net attributable	     54.03     55.85    49.68 -  56.96</p>
<p>CONTRIBUTORS: Argentaria, Benito y Monjardin, BSN, Ahorro Corporacion, ABN AMRO, and AB Asesores.</p>
<p>NOTE: Argentaria will announce its 1996 Q3 results at the end of the month.</p>
</text>
